	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r16_swbell_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そっかあ……
じゃあ　せつめい　するね▼
きと　きの　あいだに
ポケモンが　かくれそうな　あなが▽
ときどき　みつかるんだよ▼
それを　そのまんま
かくしあな　って　よんでるの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:50:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:10:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そっかあ……
じゃあ　説明するね▼
木と　木の　あいだに
ポケモンが　隠れそうな　穴が▽
ときどき　みつかるんだよ▼
それを　そのまんま
隠し穴　って　呼んでるの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T11:01:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:31:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・いいえ選択時
・続けてswbell_08</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:50:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBELL
ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T11:57:27" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r16_swbell_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あのね　この　あたりで　なにか
ものおとが　きこえたから▽
かくしあな　ありそうなんだよねえ▼
というわけで
いっしょに　さがそうよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:50:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:17:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あのね　この辺りで　なにか
物音が　きこえたから▽
隠し穴　ありそうなんだよねえ▼
というわけで
いっしょに　探そうよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T11:02:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:31:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けて
・誘導
　そらをとぶ禁止
　posで移動制限</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:50:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBELL
ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T12:04:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
